# frames-cursor.jsonl after seq 3. The generator prints abcdefghij, moves left five, erases to the end of the line and
# prints |after-erase on row 3, then writes row2 at 2;1 over the first four cells of the command line and "moved" at 1;3.
size 80 24
cursor 2 1 visible
screen primary
text 1 |  moved
text 2 |row2/paddock-test-ws ❯ /tmp/paddock-test-ws/fx-cursor.sh
text 3 |abcde|after-erase
style 2 5-20 bold fg=6
style 2 22 bold fg=6
